// Writer (Watch), wave 1b. Senior Watch Officer, Holt's deputy, the night Watch; easy laugh, watchful, patient.
//
// HOW THEY TALK: Big, easy laugh; relaxed, but his eyes keep moving. Calls the ship "she". Tells a story slowly and always lands it. The only one who can make Holt laugh, and is a bit proud of it.
// WITH JUNIORS: patient, walks them through the night rounds deck by deck.
// MOOD TELLS: quiet laugh means tired; no laugh at all means something's wrong.
